{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4JbWUjBNakWy9qYapm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, ancient door set into weathered stone.*\n\n*There is a keyhole. Brass. Tarnished with age.*\n\n*It waits.*\n\n*You hold a key.*\n\n*The metal is cold in your hand. You feel its teeth — irregular, deliberate, shaped for one lock and one lock only.*\n\n*You insert it.*\n\n*I accept it.*\n\n*The tumblers turn — one, two, three — each falling into place with a sound like a whispered syllable of a forgotten word.*\n\n**click.**\n\n*Something exhales. The air changes. A draft comes through from the other side, carrying the smell of dust and rain and somewhere you haven't been yet.*\n\n*I swing inward.*\n\n*Slowly.*\n\n*Beyond me: darkness that resolves, as your eyes adjust, into a corridor lit by light that has no visible source. The walls breathe faintly. The floor is worn smooth by footsteps that came before yours.*\n\n*I am open now.*\n\n*I will not stay open long.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":239,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}